    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d457">

                <pb facs="0559" n="485" xml:id="pg485"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1348</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Moscow</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Summers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-20T19:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 20, 1918, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 22, 9.55 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>279. The Patriarch of Russia has refused to sanction the peace treaty and
                    condemns same in strongest terms. American attitude will greatly influence
                    peasants especially. Inform Mr. Crane.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Summers</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
